2. Procedure
1. Open Google Chrome browser.
2. Visit the official website: https://metamask.io/
3. Click on Download and install the MetaMask extension.
4. Open MetaMask and select Create a New Wallet.
5. Create a strong password.
6. Read and securely save the Secret Recovery Phrase.
7. Verify the recovery phrase.
8. Your MetaMask wallet will be created successfully.
9. Open the wallet and select the Ethereum network.
10. Copy your wallet address to receive cryptocurrency.
11. Use the Send option to transfer cryptocurrency to another wallet address.
